  - hexagonal-architecture
  - experiment-orchestration
abstract: >-
  The reporter relays one acquisition engine's document stream to a system of
  record, as reports about the steps that record dispatched, and says where
  the data those steps produced is being kept. It creates nothing: a report
  naming no dispatched step is refused at the far end. The package is split in
  two halves, one that reads an engine and one that talks to the record, so a
  second engine is a translator rather than a rewrite. It is a client of the
  keeper, a separate deployable bound to it by prose and two metadata keys
  rather than by a shared package.
